 ('ENT_ALC_QUEEN','PER_ALCHEMY','The White Queen / Luna, lunar ''feminine'' partner of the royal pair in the chymical wedding; counterpart of the King in the practiced coniunctio.'),
 ('ENT_ALC_REBIS','PER_ALCHEMY','The Rebis, the conjoined hermaphroditic offspring of the King and Queen embodying the union of opposites (coniunctio); a central goal-image of the alchemical work.'),
